{"id":30362,"artist":"Jimmy Buffett","title":"Boat Drinks","lyrics_plain":"Boat drinks\nBoys in the band ordered boat drinks\nVisitors scored on the home rink\nEverything seems to be wrong\n\nLately, newspaper mentioned cheap airfare\nI've got to fly to Saint Somewhere\nI'm close to bodily harm\n\n20 degress and the hockey game's on\nNobody cares, they are way too far gone\nScreamin', \"Boat drinks\"\nSomethin' to keep them all warm\n\nThis morning\nI shot six holes in my freezer\nI think I got cabin fever\nSomebody sound the alarm\n\nI'd like to go where the pace of life's slow\nCould you beam me somewhere, Mister Scott?\nAny old place here on Earth or in Space\nYou pick the century and I'll pick the spot\n\nOh I know (I know)\nI should be leaving this climate\nI got a verse but can't rhyme it\nI gotta go where it's warm\n\nBoat drinks\nWaitress, I need two more boat drinks\nThen I'm headin' south 'fore my dream shrinks\nI gotta go where it's warm (I gotta go where it's warm)\nI gotta go where it's warm (I gotta go where it's warm)\nI gotta go where it's warm!\n\nI gotta go where there ain't any snow\nWhere there ain't any blow, 'cause my fin sinks so low\nI gotta go where it's warm","lyrics_synced":"[00:15.44] Boat drinks\n[00:17.38] Boys in the band ordered boat drinks\n[00:21.14] Visitors scored on the home rink\n[00:25.04] Everything seems to be wrong\n[00:30.59] Lately, newspaper mentioned cheap airfare\n[00:36.40] I've got to fly to Saint Somewhere\n[00:40.16] I'm close to bodily harm\n[00:44.04] 20 degress and the hockey game's on\n[00:48.41] Nobody cares, they are way too far gone\n[00:51.23] Screamin', \"Boat drinks\"\n[00:53.66] Somethin' to keep them all warm\n[00:59.35] This morning\n[01:01.35] I shot six holes in my freezer\n[01:05.50] I think I got cabin fever\n[01:09.16] Somebody sound the alarm\n[01:13.21] I'd like to go where the pace of life's slow\n[01:16.49] Could you beam me somewhere, Mister Scott?\n[01:21.16] Any old place here on Earth or in